    <h1>Instant Noodles</h1>
     
    <img src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcT08dYJ7y4mUVZeYrPpJh2_APVySo_ho3d2QN4dO8007g&s=10"><InstantNoodles>
    <p>Instant noodles are a popular, convenient dish made from precooked and dried noodle blocks. Celebrated globally as a quick, versatile comfort food, they are typically boiled in water and mixed with a savory seasoning packet, and can easily be upgraded with fresh toppings like eggs, vegetables and proteins.</p>
    
    <h2>ingredients</h2>
    
    <ul>
        <li>Instant noodle pack</li>
        <li>Water</li>
        <li>Seasoning packet</li>
        <li>Egg</li>
        <li>Vegetables</li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>Steps</h2>

    <ol>
        <li>Boil water in a small pot or saucepan</li>
        <li>Add the noodle block and cook for 3 minutes until tender</li>
        <li>Stir in the seasoning packet thoroughly</li>
        <li>Add an egg or optional veggies if desired</li>
        <li>Serve hot</li>
    </ol>

